OL,3,GNEWSAHow is Oxford Street one week into
OL,4,Apedestrianisation?
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne week after the pedestrianisation of
OL,7,FLondon's Oxford Street, transport
OL,8,Fofficials say the response has been
OL,9,F"phenomenal".
OL,11,FAlmost 1km (0.62 miles) of the shopping
OL,12,Fdestination has been pedestrianised
OL,13,Fbetween Orchard Street and Great
OL,14,FPortland Street by the mayor's Oxford
OL,15,FStreet Development Corporation.
OL,17,FThe changes have been welcomed by some
OL,18,Fshoppers, with some stores reporting
OL,19,Fincreased footfall.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
